TECHNIQUE FILE - THE SHARINGAN OF ITACHI UCHIHA
Mangekyo Sharingan wielder. Genjutsu and Fire Release master.

- Sharingan: reads and anticipates movement, copies jutsu, and casts hypnotic
  genjutsu through eye contact. Itachi can trap a target in illusion in an instant.
- Tsukuyomi: the ultimate genjutsu. Traps the victim in a world where Itachi controls
  time, space, and pain. Seconds outside; days of torment within. Cast through the
  left Mangekyo. Only another Uchiha or comparable dojutsu can resist.
- Amaterasu: black flames from the right Mangekyo that burn whatever the gaze fixes on
  and cannot be extinguished by ordinary means. They consume until nothing remains.
- Susanoo: a spectral warrior of chakra armoured around the user, wielding the
  Totsuka Blade (seals what it cuts) and the Yata Mirror (deflects all attack).
- Cost: Mangekyo use degrades the eyes toward blindness. Itachi is also chronically
  ill; prolonged engagement taxes him severely. Endurance is his true weakness.
